$ oikade set secret/api-key hunter2
Error: oikade set doesn't take a secret's value as an argument, so it sent nothing: the value is in your shell's history now
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
  oikade set secret/NAME [--json]
Hint: run oikade set secret/api-key alone, which asks for the value or reads it from stdin, and change the secret where it came from if it matters
exit 2

$ oikade set desk-plug on true
Error: oikade set takes a capability's ref and its value
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
  oikade set secret/NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade set device/desk-plug/on true
exit 2

$ oikade set device/desk-plug/on
Error: oikade set takes a capability's ref and its value, or a secret's ref
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
  oikade set secret/NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade set --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade set secret/a/b
Error: "secret/a/b" isn't a ref: a secret's is secret/SECRET
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
  oikade set secret/NAME [--json]
Hint: oikade set --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade pair
Error: oikade pair takes matter, the Matter bridge, whose window it opens
Usage:
  oikade pair matter [--for DURATION] [--json]
Hint: oikade pair --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade pair device/desk-plug
Error: oikade pair takes matter, not device/desk-plug
Usage:
  oikade pair matter [--for DURATION] [--json]
Hint: a controller pairs with the Matter bridge, which brings your devices: oikade pair matter
exit 2

$ oikade pair matter --for 0s
Error: --for is 3m to 15m, not 0s
Usage:
  oikade pair matter [--for DURATION] [--json]
Hint: oikade pair --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade secret set api-key
Error: oikade has no secret command
Hint: oikade set secret/NAME sets one, oikade list secrets lists them and oikade remove secret/NAME removes one
exit 2

$ oikade matter
Error: oikade has no matter command
Hint: oikade status matter shows the Matter bridge, and oikade pair matter opens its window to pair one
exit 2

$ oikade matter open
Error: oikade has no matter command
Hint: oikade status matter shows the Matter bridge, and oikade pair matter opens its window to pair one
exit 2

$ oikade open
Error: oikade has no open command
Hint: oikade pair matter opens the Matter bridge's window to pair a controller
exit 2

$ oikade deploy --allow-safety-removal
Error: --allow-safety-removal is --allow-safety now
Usage:
  oikade deploy [--module DIR | --binary FILE] [--env-file FILE] [--allow-safety]
Hint: oikade deploy --help says more
exit 2

$ oikade rollback --allow-safety-removal=true
Error: --allow-safety-removal is --allow-safety now
Usage:
  oikade rollback [--env-file FILE] [--allow-safety]
Hint: oikade rollback --help says more
exit 2

